# ── Linking YOUR Claude account (Pro/Max subscription — no API key) ─────────
# Model calls run on your own Claude subscription. Pick ONE:
#
#   Option A (local dev): run `claude` then `/login` once on this machine.
#     Nothing to put here.
#
#   Option B (Docker/headless): mint a long-lived subscription token with
#     `claude setup-token` — or, with zero host installs:
#     `docker compose run --rm auth`
#     Then paste the token here:
# CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=

# Optional: compiler override (defaults to g++ found on PATH / MSYS2)
# CXX=clang++

# Optional: Python interpreter override (defaults to python3/python on PATH)
# PYTHON=python3
